"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.26%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.74%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_us-gaap_ResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseMember_Pd88xn670kmwysaNi49KAA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Tc_J6RZ-BcRPkq6c4i1Cdj8qw_5_6">338</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:66.06%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Stock-based compensation costs before income taxes</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.64%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.25%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.97%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_LPa-h9eBZU2rhZHhfF1odw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Tc_94qb0Jbe20qB2tEhEZUjjQ_6_3">1,506</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.05%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.26%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.74%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_AqX3R0jBaU-SjgEGIqQerQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Tc_T78t5R_7mEuKmO_xtqbZRQ_6_6">1,157</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2018 Plan</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In May 2018, the Company&#8217;s stockholders approved the 2018 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2018 Plan&#8221;), under which Cyclacel may make equity incentive grants to its officers, employees, directors and consultants. The 2018 Plan replaced the 2015 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2015 Plan&#8221;).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The 2018 Plan allows for various types of award grants, including stock options and restricted stock units. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 14, 2022, the Company&#8217;s stockholders approved an increase of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="Duration_6_14_2022_To_6_14_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_EquityIncentivePlan2018Member_-7BMjzwpDEqa5UzcRQuTIg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_IxGgTv3nqk-8PT_nySdBnQ">500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock to be reserved for issuance under the 2018 Plan. As of December 31, 2022, the Company has <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_EquityIncentivePlan2018Member_t2hFKmEH1UWTnVIcKrcmrg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_kB036YFbkE6M5sEtYx_KSw">392,396</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock reserved and available for issuance under the 2018 Plan, including shares that were available under the 2015 Plan and carried forward to the 2018 Plan. Stock option awards granted under the Company&#8217;s equity incentive plans have a maximum life of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_EquityIncentivePlan2018Member_ku5H3AaR30qDEiHjw7VEVQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_LBaEZ1EjIUu3DQKR1TJF9w">10 years</ix:nonNumeric> and generally vest over a <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_HkNioXCbG0a4eqwYu66UMg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">one</span></span> to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_SbGNvJsF7UCxZEtrco0gVA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">four-year</span></span> period from the date of grant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2020 Inducement Equity Incentive Plan&#160;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In October 2020, the Inducement Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;Inducement Plan&#8221;), became effective. Under the Inducement Plan, Cyclacel may make equity incentive grants to new senior level Employees (persons to whom the Company may issue securities without stockholder approval). The Inducement Plan allows for the issuance of up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="As_Of_10_31_2020_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_InducementEquityIncentivePlan2020Member_ImHbF0uJ5kWwUWkJ82kwLg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_oNgEQi6spka1zK96Qg80lg">200,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock (or the equivalent of such number). As of December 31, 2022, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_InducementEquityIncentivePlan2020Member_JRhauW3VGEuUCCwnwK-Mcg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_N_Mu2-tZ4k2uvIp5g9CgPg">120,000</ix:nonFraction> shares under the Inducement Plan have been issued, leaving a remaining reserve of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_cycc_InducementEquityIncentivePlan2020Member_JRhauW3VGEuUCCwnwK-Mcg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_PjcS2jXYVEGY49DDNLr9GQ">80,000</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Option Grants and Exercises</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_AqX3R0jBaU-SjgEGIqQerQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_KuCUDsX35UOJJDL3fcvSKA">552,153</ix:nonFraction> options granted during the year ended December 31, 2021, all issued under the 2018 Plan. There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_LPa-h9eBZU2rhZHhfF1odw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_TAc2ctZbUkqHPtnvgEHZSQ">522,337</ix:nonFraction> options granted during the year ended December 31, 2022, all issued under the 2018 Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The weighted average grant-date fair values of options granted during the years ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2022 were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jfdFUlNSV0qcnxaW6J7NSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_rYyOrEY-IkS7VbvmPeeJ_A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cycc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_ObJOHy49MUqXV8jM3O1-Tw">3.36</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_jfdFUlNSV0qcnxaW6J7NSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_ymKcjN7O1EavM5bG-ovs3Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="cycc:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_mKZktAMI10mkRXaNf_lfrg">1.76</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December&#160;31, 2022, the total remaining unrecognized compensation cost related to the unvested stock options with service conditions amounted to approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_U85gYFkYYkyZJ9AIMsGNYg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="6" id="Narr_l0VVQntFHEuDJP1KnFINbg">2.0</ix:nonFraction> million, which will be amortized over the weighted-average remaining requisite service period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_LPa-h9eBZU2rhZHhfF1odw" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_iM9aiqkVxUu7y2-WUXTkHA">1.4</ix:nonNumeric> years.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the years ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2022, the Company did not settle any equity instruments with cash.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_AqX3R0jBaU-SjgEGIqQerQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_241UeGJxEEGk4YDf-74LPQ">6,600</ix:nonFraction> stock option exercises during the year ended 2021. There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_-YBxS00-XkuQkothZsMe1w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_LPa-h9eBZU2rhZHhfF1odw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_7V0Y2zZFWESDzFA02zImZg">no</ix:nonFraction> stock option exercises during the year ended 2022. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_AqX3R0jBaU-SjgEGIqQerQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationTaxBenefitFromExerciseOfStockOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_8vBQwr2bQkqBGYrh23xdMw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_OUe9CJ22uEqidq9cx6kI5g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_LPa-h9eBZU2rhZHhfF1odw" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationTaxBenefitFromExerciseOfStockOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_Otv11X58602t0YdQraiELQ">No</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> income tax benefits were recorded for the years ended December&#160;<span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">31, 2021 and 2022.  The Company does not expect to be able to benefit from the deduction for stock option exercises that may occur because the Company has tax loss carryforwards from prior periods that would be expected to offset any potential taxable income.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">101</p></div></div>
